# Conformance probe pack for `stop 59` on a 48-bit `ascii8` field (spec 0.22,
# ruling 21): the text ends at the first `;`; NUL before it is an ordinary
# character. Public. No kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   bytes 0..5    label  up to 5 characters, `;`, then NUL padding
format     conformance-long-stop-semicolon
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  0:0:48  chars:ascii8  stop 59
